@startuml DIAGRAM_04_SWIMLANE_10_EN
'==============================================================
' AIVES - SWIMLANE 10 ACTIVITY (new, for slides) - English version
' 5 lanes, EXACTLY 10 activities (UC-01..UC-10) + 3 error branches
' Does NOT modify any existing file / old diagram.
' Source: AIVES SRS 07/11/2026
'==============================================================
title DIAGRAM 4 - SWIMLANE 10 ACTIVITY (AIVES)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EAF1F7
  BorderColor #1F3B52
  BorderThickness 2.2
  FontSize 19
  FontStyle bold
  FontColor #10243A
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3CD
  DiamondBorderColor #B8860B
  DiamondFontSize 17
  DiamondFontStyle bold
  DiamondBorderThickness 2
  ConditionFontSize 17
  ConditionFontStyle bold
  ArrowFontSize 19
  ArrowFontStyle bold
  ArrowThickness 2.6
}
skinparam ArrowFontSize 19
skinparam ArrowFontStyle bold
skinparam ArrowThickness 2.6
skinparam ArrowColor #1F3B52
skinparam PartitionBackgroundColor #D7E3EC
skinparam PartitionBorderColor #1F3B52
skinparam PartitionFontSize 19
skinparam PartitionFontStyle bold
skinparam TitleFontSize 26
skinparam TitleFontStyle bold
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 19

|ADMIN|
start
:UC-01 Manage accounts, roles & courses;

|STAFF|
:UC-02 Upload .md material -> generate & approve AI questions;
:UC-03 Build exam paper & schedule sessions;
:UC-04 Enroll students & distribute papers;

|STUDENT|
:UC-05 Take the exam & record answers;

|SYSTEM (Backend + AI + Hangfire)|
if (Submission valid?) then (No)
  #FFE8CC:SUBMIT ERROR - 400/403, student retries;
  detach
else (Yes)
endif
:UC-06 AI transcribes speech & grades by rubric\n(retry 30s/120s/300s);
if (Grading failed?) then (Yes)
  #FFE8CC:GRADING ERROR - FAILED, examiner grades manually or re-grades;
  detach
else (No)
endif
:UC-07 Persist result PENDING_REVIEW + audit log;

|EXAMINER|
:UC-08 Review evidence & assign the official score;
if (Ready to publish?) then (No)
  #FFE8CC:PUBLISH ERROR - 409, review again then publish;
  detach
else (Yes)
endif
if (Incident to handle?) then (Yes)
  :UC-09 Handle incident: re-grade one answer / grant retake;
else (No)
endif

|STUDENT|
:UC-10 View the published result (PUBLISHED);
stop

legend right
  |= Colour |= Meaning |
  | <#EAF1F7> | **10 activities** (UC-01 ... UC-10) |
  | <#FFE8CC> | **3 error branches** (submit / grading / publish) |
  | <#FFF3CD> | Decision condition |
endlegend

@enduml
